Note on data sources:

- Open data from official Colombian sources (DANE, IDECA, SDP, IDRD, Secretaría
  de Seguridad, IGAC) is used under their respective licenses.
- Real estate listing data was collected via web scraping from publicly
  accessible portals exclusively for academic research purposes under fair
  use principles. No personal information from listing owners or advertisers
  is stored or distributed.
- The Encuesta de Percepción y Victimización (EPV 2024) data is courtesy of
  the Cámara de Comercio de Bogotá.
